  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Initially beat frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p><p>so, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>340</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>345</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>335</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>after filing frequency increases slightly so, new value of frequency of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></math></p><p>Now, beat frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> new <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>340</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>342</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>338</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p><p>hence, original frequency of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>335</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p>",
